  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Fixes\n\nGenerated file names no longer collide (#80, closes #79). This is a regression in 0.2.0. A generic target and a type named like its sanitized form got the same generated file name, e.g. IFoo\\<int> and IFoo\\_int\\_ both got IFoo\\_int\\_Imposter.g.cs. Roslyn then dropped every file of the generator, so no imposter was generated for the project (warning CS8785).\n\nPlain names such as Sample.IFooImposter.g.cs are unchanged.\n\nNames of generic targets, or names that contain \\_, now end with a short stable hash, e.g. Sample.IRepository\\_TEntity\\_Imposter.6b1618b2.g.cs.\n\nGenerated namespaces and type names are unchanged.",
